<details><summary>Prototype (or local override)</summary>

The HTML template used by the tutorials listing is stored here https://github.com/rstudio/rstudio/blob/51009f4cff7b0f45f9bd8762d7c0514b0de537bd/src/cpp/session/resources/tutorial_resources/index.html

